{"maxId":378,"entries":{"copy|Parkinson disease and related disorders":["u1"],"pd-recognition|Parkinsonism and diagnostic uncertainty":["u2"],"pd-risk-associations|Risk associations and pathogenic mechanisms":["u327"],"pd-differential|Patterns that change the differential":["u3"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Finding|TH|Finding":["u68"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Finding|TH|Alternative diagnosis":["u69"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: encephalitis|TH|History: encephalitis":["u70"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: encephalitis|TD|Postencephalitic parkinsonism":["u71"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: carbon monoxide, manganese or other toxins|TH|History: carbon monoxide, manganese or other toxins":["u72"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: carbon monoxide, manganese or other toxins|TD|Toxin-induced parkinsonism":["u73"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: recent neuroleptic or metoclopramide exposure|TH|History: recent neuroleptic or metoclopramide exposure":["u74"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: recent neuroleptic or metoclopramide exposure|TD|Drug-induced parkinsonism":["u75"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: head trauma|TH|History: head trauma":["u76"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: head trauma|TD|Posttraumatic parkinsonism":["u77"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: stroke|TH|History: stroke":["u78"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:History: stroke|TD|Vascular parkinsonism":["u79"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Cerebellar ataxia|TH|Cerebellar ataxia":["u80"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Cerebellar ataxia|TD|MSA; primary ataxic disorders":["u81"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Loss of downward ocular movements|TH|Loss of downward ocular movements":["u82"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Loss of downward ocular movements|TD|PSP":["u83"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Pronounced postural hypotension not due to concurrent medication|TH|Pronounced postural hypotension not due to concurrent medication":["u84"],"c61-exclusion-pairs|row:Pronounced postural hypotension not due to concurrent medication|TD|M